About Me



The person behind the horse photo.




Who I Am



I’m Alnura, a 3rd year Data Science and Society student at Central European University, originally from Kazakhstan. I ended up in data science because it turns out numbers can be applied to pretty much everything — politics, behaviour, games, economies, people’s feelings about democracy. That’s the appeal. You pick a question that matters and data gives you a way to actually look at it.



When I’m not doing that, I’m cooking something that may or may not have followed the recipe, and thinking about horses.




